{"1794750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stay with Me! Alien Abduction Story", "steam_appid": 1794750, "required_age": "16", "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1748796229\" width=591 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1748796229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Stay with Me! Alien Abduction Story is a psychological horror narrative game. Experience firsthand the damage fear can do to your mind by getting lost alone in a series of unexplained events. As a player we will control who will be involved in a series of events for normals from another world<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/dc1f5ea839be6ef72aa816a9e299c85d.poster.avif?t=1748796229\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/dc1f5ea839be6ef72aa816a9e299c85d.webm?t=1748796229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/dc1f5ea839be6ef72aa816a9e299c85d.mp4?t=1748796229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This is the story of Ana, whose whereabouts have not been known since November 1999, who has also filmed her last hours before disappearing, as a player we will try to find out what happened to her, a game with a gloomy setting, where sound plays a role important in the adventure, full of mysteries and strange creatures (apparently not from this world) will haunt us throughout the story.<br><br>Can you find out what happened to Ana?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/8ee370bec6bb763cc80e98f2082f861b.poster.avif?t=1748796229\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/8ee370bec6bb763cc80e98f2082f861b.webm?t=1748796229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/8ee370bec6bb763cc80e98f2082f861b.mp4?t=1748796229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game is inspired by iconic movies from the 80s and 90s, as well as popular alien encounter stories.<br><br>Its artistic section evokes the style of a home movie, immersing the player in a mystery that they must unravel. The gameplay, without any external help, reflects real life and the decisions made during the adventure will determine the various possible outcomes and endings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/a0027b5f81196f02fd08ec8b5a8e1e72.poster.avif?t=1748796229\" width=582 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/a0027b5f81196f02fd08ec8b5a8e1e72.webm?t=1748796229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/a0027b5f81196f02fd08ec8b5a8e1e72.mp4?t=1748796229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Visual style reminiscent of home movies shot on VHS<br></li><li>First person and Third person view<br></li><li>You can select whether to play in 16:9 / Ultra Wide or 4:3 for a more realistic experience<br></li><li>This game is packed with endings, each of which will give you a unique experience every time you play it. Each start of the game will take you to different situations, and will surprise you with new outcomes each time.</li></ul><br>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1748796229\" width=591 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1748796229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Stay with Me! Alien Abduction Story is a psychological horror narrative game. Experience firsthand the damage fear can do to your mind by getting lost alone in a series of unexplained events. As a player we will control who will be involved in a series of events for normals from another world<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/dc1f5ea839be6ef72aa816a9e299c85d.poster.avif?t=1748796229\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/dc1f5ea839be6ef72aa816a9e299c85d.webm?t=1748796229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/dc1f5ea839be6ef72aa816a9e299c85d.mp4?t=1748796229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This is the story of Ana, whose whereabouts have not been known since November 1999, who has also filmed her last hours before disappearing, as a player we will try to find out what happened to her, a game with a gloomy setting, where sound plays a role important in the adventure, full of mysteries and strange creatures (apparently not from this world) will haunt us throughout the story.<br><br>Can you find out what happened to Ana?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/8ee370bec6bb763cc80e98f2082f861b.poster.avif?t=1748796229\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/8ee370bec6bb763cc80e98f2082f861b.webm?t=1748796229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/8ee370bec6bb763cc80e98f2082f861b.mp4?t=1748796229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game is inspired by iconic movies from the 80s and 90s, as well as popular alien encounter stories.<br><br>Its artistic section evokes the style of a home movie, immersing the player in a mystery that they must unravel. The gameplay, without any external help, reflects real life and the decisions made during the adventure will determine the various possible outcomes and endings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/a0027b5f81196f02fd08ec8b5a8e1e72.poster.avif?t=1748796229\" width=582 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/a0027b5f81196f02fd08ec8b5a8e1e72.webm?t=1748796229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794750/extras/a0027b5f81196f02fd08ec8b5a8e1e72.mp4?t=1748796229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Visual style reminiscent of home movies shot on VHS<br></li><li>First person and Third person view<br></li><li>You can select whether to play in 16:9 / Ultra Wide or 4:3 for a more realistic experience<br></li><li>This game is packed with endings, each of w